#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:148
msgid ""
"Workers call the same typed operations through either ZMQ (DEALER/ROUTER)"
" or gRPC. The handler scheduling contract is transport-neutral."
msgstr "工作进程通过 ZMQ (DEALER/ROUTER) 或 gRPC 调用相同类型的操作。处理程序调度合同与传输无关。"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:151
msgid ""
"ZMQ encodes requests as msgspec multipart messages over DEALER/ROUTER "
"sockets; gRPC encodes the same operations with protobuf. Both dispatch by"
" operation name; see :doc:`request_transport` for endpoint selection and "
"wire details."
msgstr "ZMQ 将请求编码为通过 DEALER/ROUTER 套接字传输的 msgspec 多部分消息；gRPC 使用 protobuf 编码相同的操作。两者都通过操作名称进行分发；有关端点选择和传输细节，请参见 :doc:`request_transport`。"

