"path (CUDA IPC); loaded only when ``--supported-transfer-mode`` is "
"``lmcache_driven`` or ``auto``."
msgstr ""
"将 KV Cache 块从 L1 (CPU) 复制回 GPU。由 LMCache 驱动的传输路径 (CUDA IPC)；仅在 "
"``--supported-transfer-mode`` 为 ``lmcache_driven`` 或 ``auto`` 时加载。"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:191
msgid "``PREPARE_STORE``"
msgstr "``PREPARE_STORE``"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:193
msgid ""
"(Engine-driven path) Worker asks the server to prepare store-side "
"transfer state for a key. Loaded when ``--supported-transfer-mode`` is "
"``engine_driven`` or ``auto``."
msgstr ""
"（引擎驱动路径）工作线程请求服务器为一个键准备存储端传输状态。当 ``--supported-transfer-mode`` 设置为 "
"``engine_driven`` 或 ``auto`` 时加载。"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:196
msgid "``COMMIT_STORE``"
msgstr "``COMMIT_STORE``"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:198
msgid ""
"(Engine-driven path) Worker commits the chunk's serialized bytes (pickle "
"path) or releases the prepared SHM slot (SHM path) so the server can "
"persist into L1 storage."
msgstr "（引擎驱动路径）工作线程提交块的序列化字节（pickle 路径），或释放已准备好的共享内存槽（SHM 路径），以便服务器将数据持久化到 L1 存储。"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:201
msgid "``PREPARE_RETRIEVE``"
msgstr "``PREPARE_RETRIEVE``"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:203
msgid ""
"(Engine-driven path) Worker asks the server to prepare the retrieval "
"payload for a key. The pickle path returns the bytes inline; the SHM path"
" returns slot info so the worker can read from shared memory."
msgstr "（引擎驱动路径）工作线程请求服务器为指定键准备检索负载。pickle 路径直接内联返回字节；SHM 路径返回槽位信息，供工作线程从共享内存中读取。"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:207
msgid "``COMMIT_RETRIEVE``"
msgstr "``COMMIT_RETRIEVE``"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:209
msgid ""
"(Engine-driven path) Worker acknowledges retrieval completion so the "
"server can release the underlying read locks and reclaim any transport "
"state."
msgstr "（引擎驱动路径）工作线程确认检索完成，服务器随即释放底层读取锁并回收相关传输状态。"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:212
msgid "``LOOKUP``"
msgstr "``LOOKUP``"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:214
msgid ""
"Submit a prefix lookup; the prefetch job is tracked server-side by "
"request_id."
msgstr "提交前缀查找；预取任务由 request_id 在服务器端跟踪。"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:216
msgid "``QUERY_PREFETCH_STATUS``"
msgstr "``QUERY_PREFETCH_STATUS``"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:218
msgid ""
"Poll a prefetch job by request_id. Returns the loaded chunk count when "
"done, or ``None`` while the prefetch is still in progress."
msgstr "通过 request_id 查询预取作业。当完成时返回已加载的块数，预取仍在进行中时返回 ``None``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:220
msgid "``WAIT_PREFETCH_STATUS``"
msgstr "``WAIT_PREFETCH_STATUS``"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:222
msgid ""
"(SGLang only) Block until a prefetch job completes, then return its "
"loaded chunk count, or ``None`` on timeout. The blocking alternative to "
"polling ``QUERY_PREFETCH_STATUS``."
msgstr ""
"（仅限 SGLang）阻塞直到预取作业完成，然后返回其加载的块数，超时则返回 ``None``。这是轮询 "
"``QUERY_PREFETCH_STATUS`` 的阻塞替代方案。"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:225
msgid "``QUERY_PREFETCH_LOOKUP_HITS``"
msgstr "``QUERY_PREFETCH_LOOKUP_HITS``"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:227
msgid ""
"Query the lookup-phase hit chunk count by request_id, before the prefetch"
" finishes. Returns ``None`` while the lookup is still running."
msgstr "在预取完成之前，通过 request_id 查询查找阶段的命中块计数。当查找仍在运行时返回 ``None``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:230
msgid "``FREE_LOOKUP_LOCKS``"
msgstr "``FREE_LOOKUP_LOCKS``"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:232
msgid "Release read locks from a cancelled lookup without doing a full RETRIEVE."
msgstr "从取消的查找中释放读取锁，而无需执行完整的检索。"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:234
msgid "``END_SESSION``"
msgstr "``END_SESSION``"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:236
