#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:254
msgid "``CB_REGISTER_ROPE``"
msgstr "``CB_REGISTER_ROPE``"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:256
msgid ""
"(Blend) Share the RoPE cos/sin cache onto a context already registered "
"via ``REGISTER_KV_CACHE``."
msgstr "将 RoPE cos/sin 缓存共享到已经通过 ``REGISTER_KV_CACHE`` 注册的上下文中。"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:258
msgid "``CB_UNREGISTER_ROPE``"
msgstr "``CB_UNREGISTER_ROPE``"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:260
msgid ""
"(Blend) Drop the RoPE state (paged KV cache lives on; use "
"``UNREGISTER_KV_CACHE`` to release that)."
msgstr "(Blend) 丢弃 RoPE 状态（分页 KV Cache 仍然存在；使用 ``UNREGISTER_KV_CACHE`` 来释放它）。"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:262
msgid "``CB_RETRIEVE_PRE_COMPUTED``"
msgstr "``CB_RETRIEVE_PRE_COMPUTED``"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:264
msgid ""
"(Blend) Scatter all matched chunks (prefix- and non-prefix-hit) into "
"paged KV by per-token block ID; re-RoPE only the shifted subset."
msgstr "将所有匹配的块（前缀命中和非前缀命中）按每个令牌块 ID 散布到分页 KV 中；仅对移位子集进行重新 RoPE。"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:266
msgid "``CB_UNIFIED_LOOKUP``"
msgstr "``CB_UNIFIED_LOOKUP``"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:268
msgid ""
"(Blend) Sole lookup path: one RPC runs prefix + non-prefix match, "
"reconciles, issues one sparse-coalesced prefetch, and classifies per-TP-"
"rank. Returns ``CBUnifiedLookupResult`` (or ``None`` while the prefetch "
"is still in flight)."
msgstr "（Blend）唯一查找路径：一个 RPC 运行前缀 + 非前缀匹配，进行协调，发出一个稀疏合并的预取，并按每个 TP 排名进行分类。返回 ``CBUnifiedLookupResult``（或者在预取仍在进行中时返回 ``None``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:272
msgid "``P2P_LOOKUP_AND_LOCK``"
msgstr "``P2P_LOOKUP_AND_LOCK``"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:274
msgid ""
"(P2P) Look up the given keys and read-lock the locally cached prefix. "
"Returns a task id which the caller passes to ``P2P_QUERY_LOOKUP_RESULTS``"
" to poll for the transfer addresses. Served by ``P2PController`` (loaded "
"unconditionally by ``_build_modules()``); whether this server also acts "
"as a P2P client is controlled by ``--p2p-advertise-url`` -- see "
":doc:`p2p`."
msgstr ""
"（P2P）查找给定的键并对本地缓存的前缀进行读锁。返回一个任务 ID，调用者将其传递给 ``P2P_QUERY_LOOKUP_RESULTS`` "
"以轮询传输地址。由 ``P2PController`` 提供服务（由 ``_build_modules()`` 无条件加载）；该服务器是否还充当 "
"P2P 客户端由 ``--p2p-advertise-url`` 控制 -- 参见 :doc:`p2p`。"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:281
msgid "``P2P_QUERY_LOOKUP_RESULTS``"
msgstr "``P2P_QUERY_LOOKUP_RESULTS``"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:283
msgid ""
"(P2P) Poll the transfer addresses for a lookup task. Returns a list of "
"``TransferChannelAddress`` once the lookup is complete, or ``None`` while"
" the lookup is still in progress or its results have already been "
"consumed."
msgstr ""
"(P2P) 查询查找任务的传输地址。查找完成后返回一个 ``TransferChannelAddress`` "
"列表，或者在查找仍在进行中或其结果已被消费时返回 ``None``。"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:287
msgid "``P2P_UNLOCK_OBJECTS``"
msgstr "``P2P_UNLOCK_OBJECTS``"

#: ../../source/mp/index.rst:289
msgid ""
"(P2P) Release the read locks previously taken by ``P2P_LOOKUP_AND_LOCK`` "
"on the given keys."
msgstr "(P2P) 释放之前由 ``P2P_LOOKUP_AND_LOCK`` 在给定键上获取的读锁。"

